{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G4-03","example":{"issue":{"title":"市區斜交路口，行人、車流與公車如何安排？","intro":"主要道路約 20 m、次要道路約 15 m，路側含停車及公車停靠需求。","images":[{"key":"results:g4-03-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[353.758,73.636,3260.289,2593.364]},{"key":"results:g4-03-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-03-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-03-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-03-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"pedestrian","title":"行人穿越缺少庇護","text":"行人穿越距離長，未提供庇護島。"},{"id":"lanes","title":"次要道路車道數不平衡","text":"進入與離開路口的車道數不同，銜接不夠清楚。"},{"id":"bus","title":"公車停靠位置不明確","text":"缺少容易辨識的停靠區範圍，路側空間需要整理。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[86,87],"strategy":{"title":"整合行人庇護、車道與公車停靠","intro":"重新分配市區斜交路口空間，讓穿越、轉向與停靠各有清楚位置。","images":[{"key":"results:g4-03-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"walking","title":"提供庇護與右轉停讓空間","text":"配置行人庇護島及錯開式行穿線，讓右轉車輛有較清楚的停讓位置。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"lanes","title":"平衡次要道路進出車道","text":"重新配置上、下游車道，搭配路口導引線，維持行車動線連續。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"bus","title":"標清公車停靠範圍","text":"以人行道外擴、路面邊線與停靠區標線，區分公車彎和一般行車空間。","moduleId":"M3-04"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-4-03-signalized-urban-skewed-cross.typ","sha256":"38f7efe8f22065fb33b1c6060ea68705a4aa624a975c8962ae0e16788e720c1f","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g4-03-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G4-03/G4-03_現況圖_01.png","width":4138,"height":2667,"label":"G4-03 現況圖","scenario":"G4-03","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":86,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image112.png","sha256":"90ca3eec4ce34b5398fd306f877187168894c3abdb3a48d8e8b9a7025be2b5e1"},"results:g4-03-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G4-03/G4-03_現況照片_01.png","width":2514,"height":1390,"label":"G4-03 現況照片","scenario":"G4-03","role":"photo","rotation":0